(i)
the general procedures at the elections including the time, place and hours of poll and the method by which votes shall
be cast;
(j)
the fee to be paid on an election petition;
(k)
any other matter relating to elections or election disputes in respect of which the Government deems it necessary to
make rules under this section or in respect of which this Act makes no provision or makes insufficient provision and the
provision is, in the opinion of the Government, necessary.
